  "_comment": "Twin vectors for the app's due rule: NimbusComputeCore.dueDateInstant (tests/js/compute-core.test.js) and backend/jobs/due.py (tests/test_jobs_due.py). Hours maps are keyed by JS weekday (0 = Sunday). due/finish are naive plant-local ISO strings.",
